    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You have learned to use the angle and distance between you and your target to devastating effect.</p><p><b>Effect:</b> When you make an attack with a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Burst\">Burst</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Splash\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Splash\">Splash</a> weapon with which you are proficient against a target at greater than Point-Blank <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>, you can affect two additional squares adjacent to the normal <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Burst\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Burst\">Burst</a> radius or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Splash\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Splash\">Splash</a> area.</p>",
